                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>A number of social psychological variables has been measured power and emotional assertiveness, affiliation, fear of negative evaluation, self-esteem, self-defence, social distress and social avoidance, the self-concept ( semantic differential ), value statements, a number of participation and evaluation scores by teachers and respondent / sociometric data.</p><p>Background variables: basic characteristics/ residence/ education/ organizational membership</p>"
